WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.670
A confirmation tag usually changes positive to negative or negative to positive and

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.773
uses the appropriate helping verb.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:11.454
Complete: “They aren't late, blank ?” Answer: are they

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:18.052
Practise ten tag questions aloud with a partner, checking tense and positive/negative

00:00:18.052 --> 00:00:18.505
balance.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.396
Why it works: A negative 'are not' statement takes 'are they?'.
